{"id":"wb-3-8","name":"绍兴鲁迅故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"鲁迅故里","text":"鲁迅故里位于中华人民共和国浙江省绍兴市越城区鲁迅中路，是绍兴市一个历史文化街区，包括鲁迅祖居（周家老台门）、鲁迅故居（周家新台门，含百草园、鲁迅笔下风情园）、三味书屋、绍兴鲁迅纪念馆以及土谷寺和绍兴古玩城。作家鲁迅于1881年在此出生并成长直至1898年离开。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B2%81%E8%BF%85%E6%95%85%E9%87%8C","revisionId":93915712,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93915712","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/33e57f78d038ce85dc57a79b.jpg","title":"绍兴鲁迅故居国保碑,_2020-09-26_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BB%8D%E5%85%B4%E9%B2%81%E8%BF%85%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91,_2020-09-26_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/%E7%BB%8D%E5%85%B4%E9%B2%81%E8%BF%85%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91%2C_2020-09-26_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​绍兴鲁迅故居国保碑","width":320,"height":214}}